						 <p>It's a setting used in some pornos. Basically, the plot is that films involving that particular couch are the actress's audition for the porn industry (or for a particular role, I have no idea). It's called the &quot;casting couch&quot;, in reference to yadda yadda <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Casting_couch">Wikipedia article</a>.</p> <p>I suspect that it's just a scene that's duplicated at a lot of different sets rather than one specific couch, but Google isn't being exceptionally cooperative on that front.</p> 
				 	]]>
